      "summary": "The No Aid for Russian Energy Act bars U.S. persons and entities they own or control from providing petroleum equipment or services to persons in the Russian Federation. It covers equipment, software, cloud and consulting for oil and gas and authorizes asset-blocking, visa bans, penalties, narrow humanitarian and medical-isotope exceptions.",
