    "impact": {
      "summary": "The bill bars U.S. persons and U.S.-owned foreign subsidiaries from providing petroleum equipment, software, cloud services, engineering, or training to persons in the Russian Federation. It authorizes Treasury/OFAC asset-blocking and State/DHS visa bans, creates penalties and presidential waivers, and exempts medical isotope and humanitarian supplies.",
